_refine.details                                  
;beautiful example of almost perfectly merohedrally twinned monoclinic form with beta=90deg, emulating orthorhombic symmetry. molecular replacement in 2mmm clashes for all space groups. pseudo-translation and anisotropy mask twinning statistics. effective resolution about 2.2A. extra residues at N-terminus engage in intermolecular beta-sheet to form non-native dimer.
;
